rd#props","content":"Props"},"139":{"id":"/docs/components/card-15","page_id":"/docs/components/card","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/card#card","content":"Card"},"140":{"id":"/docs/components/card-16","page_id":"/docs/components/card","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/card#cardselectionindicator","content":"CardSelectionIndicator"},"141":{"id":"/docs/components/card-17","page_id":"/docs/components/card","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/card","content":"Card is a layout surface. Default padding and gap are `lg`. Direct `CornerActions` sit at the\ntop-end. `href` and `onPress` add a primary action. `selection` adds a checkbox or radio; place\n`CardSelectionIndicator` yourself. Clicking the Card body toggles selection unless the Card also\nhas a primary action."},"142":{"id":"/docs/components/card-18","page_id":"/docs/components/card","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/card#default","content":"A static Card just renders its children."},"143":{"id":"/docs/components/card-19","page_id":"/docs/components/card","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/card#text-lockup","content":"Compose Card with TextLockup for eyebrow, title, and body."},"144":{"id":"/docs/components/card-20","page_id":"/docs/components/card","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/card#corner-actions","content":"Direct CornerActions sit at the top-end of the Card."},"145":{"id":"/docs/components/card-21","page_id":"/docs/components/card","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/card#link","content":"href turns the Card into a native link."},"146":{"id":"/docs/components/card-22","page_id":"/docs/components/card","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/card#media","content":"Use default padding for inset media, or zero Card padding with a padded lockup for full bleed.\nMedia can stand alone, follow the text, or be a custom Box. Clip only the media region."},"147":{"id":"/docs/components/card-23","page_id":"/docs/components/card","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/card#actions","content":"`onPress` is the Card primary. Nested buttons keep their own hits, so Save does not open the\nModal. Compose a Card inside the Modal when the action is a focused form."},"148":{"id":"/docs/components/card-24","page_id":"/docs/components/card","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/card#checkbox","content":"Standalone checkbox Cards own their state. Grouped cards belong in CheckboxGroup.\nIndicator children can render custom content from the current selection state."},"149":{"id":"/docs/components/card-25","page_id":"/docs/components/card","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/card#radio","content":"Radio Cards require a value and live in RadioGroup, which owns selection and arrow-key movement."},"150":{"id":"/docs/components/card-26","page_id":"/docs/components/card","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/card#layout","content":"Use Grid for responsiveness."},"151":{"id":"/docs/components/card-27","page_id":"/docs/components/card","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/card#customization","content":"Pass non-interactive children or a selection-state render function to `CardSelectionIndicator`\nto replace its default circle and icon. See the Checkbox example. Native selection and keyboard\nbehavior are preserved."},"152":{"id":"/docs/components/card-28","page_id":"/docs/components/card","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/card#accessibility","content":"Name a primary action with `aria-label` or `aria-labelledby`. The stretched control has no visible\nlabel of its own."},"153":{"id":"/docs/components/card-29","page_id":"/docs/components/card","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/card#accessibility","content":"Name selection separately with `selectionProps` when the Card also has a primary action."},"154":{"id":"/docs/components/card-30","page_id":"/docs/components/card","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/card#accessibility","content":"`href` turns the Card into a native link. Modifier-click, middle-click, and \"Open in new tab\" work\non the surface. Body text is not selectable. Do not put CornerActions on an `href` Card. Clicking\nbody text on an `onPress` or selection Card activates it; dragging that text selects it."},"155":{"id":"/docs/components/card-31","page_id":"/docs/components/card","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/card#accessibility","content":"`isDisabled` disables only the primary. `isSelectionDisabled` disables only selection. Radio\nread-only and validation state belong on `RadioGroup`."},"156":{"id":"/docs/components/avatar","page_id":"/docs/components/avatar","type":"page","content":"Avatar","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Components"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/avatar"},"157":{"id":"/docs/components/avatar-0","page_id":"/docs/components/avatar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/avatar","content":"A visual representation of a user or entity, shown as a photo or a monogram of their initials."},"158":{"id":"/docs/components/avatar-1","page_id":"/docs/components/avatar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/avatar#features","content":"Features"},"159":{"id":"/docs/components/avatar-2","page_id":"/docs/components/avatar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/avatar#installation","content":"Installation"},"160":{"id":"/docs/components/avatar-3","page_id":"/docs/components/avatar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/avatar#examples","content":"Examples"},"161":{"id":"/docs/components/avatar-4","page_id":"/docs/components/avatar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/avatar#default","content":"Default"},"162":{"id":"/docs/components/avatar-5","page_id":"/docs/components/avatar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/avatar#image","content":"Image"},"163":{"id":"/docs/components/avatar-6","page_id":"/docs/components/avatar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/com