570,"**Flexible sizing**: Support for `width` and `height` props"],[1242,"**Form integration**: Set `name` and the value submits as part of a native `<form>` (multiple values submit as repeated entries)"],[624,"**Full SVG Rendering**: Each icon instance renders as a complete SVG element with all path data"],[1704,"**Group gap**: Minimum 24px between bar groups"],[1716,"**Grouped rendering**: Bars are rendered in SVG `<Group>` elements for logical organization"],[1629,"**Home**"],[1719,"**Horizontal charts**: Vertical scrolling when many categories exceed container height"],[1708,"**Horizontal scrolling**: When data points exceed available width, the chart becomes horizontally scrollable"],[1898,"**HTML Elements:** When using `as=\"button\"`, TypeScript enforces button-specific props like `type`, `disabled`, and `onClick`."],[1889,"**Important**: Since `Flex` and `Grid` extend `Box`, prefer them for layouts. Use `Box` only when you need a non-flex, non-grid container."],[599,"**Important**: When you supply a `className`, you make a commitment to take over all styling of the component as it will remove the standard class names. Use data attributes for targeted styling instead."],[639,"**Initial Flash**: Brief moment where icons appear/disappear during sprite injection"],[1687,"**Interactive tooltips**: Hover to see exact values, with smart positioning and scroll-awareness"],[274,"**isInvalid**: Shows error state styling"],[273,"**isRequired**: Marks the group as required with visual indicator"],[1711,"**Keyboard navigation**: Bar groups are keyboard accessible with `tabIndex={0}` and `role=\"group\"`"],[750,"**Layout primitive**: `ListBox` and `ListBoxItem` accept layout props (`gap`, `padding`, etc.) — they extend `FlexOwnProps`."],[1648,"**Left** — when the group controls content directly below or within the same column (dashboards, tables)."],[1744,"**Limit data points**: Consider pagination or filtering for very large datasets (>100 points)"],[635,"**Lower Memory 